0..68 Comment "// What `univalence`\'s owed laws need and the checker does not have."
69..147 Comment "// `ua` after `idtoequiv` is the path once `J` reaches reflexivity, where `ua`"
148..222 Comment "// of the identity record is not reflexivity: two paths between types that"
223..301 Comment "// transport alike are not one path. `idtoequiv` after `ua` is the record once"
302..380 Comment "// its inverses are determined by its map, which needs function extensionality"
381..462 Comment "// from a homotopy at any two functions; `Path.funext` decides closed first-order"
463..505 Comment "// functions only, and `ua` gives the rest"
506..555 Comment "// (`../../model/identity/funext-from-ua.gandr`)."
556..558 Comment "//"
559..627 Comment "// - see: #520 — `uaEtaRefl`, `uaEtaStratum`, `funextFromHomotopy`"
629..679 Comment "// Univalence over the user universe: `idtoequiv`."
